====================================================================================================
Read-out guide:
  * A raw signal whose img-bal AUC c|bg is clearly >0.5 AND > baseline fused_after
    means raw scores carry release-precision info that v2 fusion lost.
  * Compare c|bg (LoveDA failure mode) and c|oth (OEM failure mode) separately.
  * If NO raw signal beats baseline on either, internal scores are insufficient
    -> external prior (RemoteCLIP / VLM / light calibration).
====================================================================================================
